# Sink into Stupor returns target spell an opponent controls to its owner's hand (CR 400.3): Bot2's Lightning Bolt
# leaves the stack unresolved and is back in Bot2's hand, not in its graveyard, so Bot1 keeps its 20 life. Black Lotus,
# cast on turn 1, pays for it in response.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Sink into Stupor
Island x5
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x5
Mountain x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Sink into Stupor.Cast(Stack.Lightning Bolt)
[T3 Bot1.Upkeep]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
Stack.Count = 0
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 2
